1.Configured two vagrant servers with mysql(Vagrantfile attached )
2.Took SchoolDB from the lecture-14 as the DB(SchoolDB_backup1 attached)
3.on the first machine i did next:
 - Create new db NewSchoolDB and create it from the dump SchoolDB_backup
 root@vagrant:/home/vagrant# mysql NewSchoolDB < /vagrant_shared/SchoolDB_backup.sql
 - change mysqld.cnf file and added following parameters
 root@vagrant:/home/vagrant# sudo nano /etc/mysql/mysql.conf.d/mysqld.cnf
 bind-address            = 0.0.0.0
 server-id=1
 log_bin = /var/log/mysql/mysql-bin.log
4.On Master DB create a user for replication
CREATE USER 'replicator'@'%' IDENTIFIED WITH mysql_native_password BY 'password';
GRANT REPLICATION SLAVE ON *.* TO 'replicator'@'%';
FLUSH PRIVILEGES;
5.Make a dump on master DB
mysqldump NewSchoolDB > /vagrant_shared/SchoolDB_backup1.sql
6.Import the database dump from the primary server:
mysql NewSchoolDB < /vagrant_shared/SchoolDB_backup1.sql
7.change the etc/mysql/mysql.conf.d/mysqld.cnf parameter
 server-id=2
8.Configure Slave to connect the Master
CHANGE MASTER TO MASTER_HOST='master_ip', MASTER_USER='replicator', MASTER_PASSWORD='password', MASTER_LOG_FILE='mysql-bin.000001', MASTER_LOG_POS=154;
START SLAVE;
